{"id":"porque","lemma":"porque","pos":"conj","rank":63,"glosses":["because","So that"],"ipa":"/ˈpoɾke/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/7a/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-porque.wav","examples":[{"text":"Lo hice porque quise.","en":"I did that willingly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/430434"},{"text":"Lo hago porque quiero.","en":"I do it because I want to.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/47757"},{"text":"Estoy aquí porque quiero.","en":"I'm here because I want to be.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/355346"},{"text":"Bostezo porque estoy cansado.","en":"I'm yawning because I'm tired.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/731786"},{"text":"No fui porque estaba enfermo.","en":"Since I was sick, I didn't go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/526895"}]}